> To[ address the] many[ challenges facing today�]�s eye care practices[ amidst] unprecedented change in the industry, CooperVision, Inc. has unveiled the Best Practices EYEdea Lab. This first-of-its-kind[ “]think[ tank”] will take place on June 21 in the exhibit hall at[ Opt]ometry[�]�s Meeting 2018 in Denver. In the EYEdea Lab, Best Practices[ hon]orees will leverage[ their] collective experiences and expertise to advance[ the] profession.

